{"name":"Baker’s Chocolate","hex":"#5c3317","fetched":"2026-10-11","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"baker","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A person who bakes and sells bread, cakes and similar items.","A portable oven for baking."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/baker"},{"term":"chocolate","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A food made from ground roasted cocoa beans.","A drink made by dissolving this food in boiling milk or water."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Made of or containing chocolate.","Having a dark reddish-brown colour/color."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/chocolate"}],"entries":[{"title":"Baker's Chocolate","blocks":[{"text":"Baker's Chocolate is a brand name for the line of baking chocolates owned by Kraft Heinz. Products include a variety of bulk chocolates, including white and unsweetened, and sweetened coconut flakes. It is one of the largest national brands of chocolate in the United States. The company was originally named Walter Baker & Company."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/4/49/Bakers_chocolate_logo.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Baker's_Chocolate","wikidata":"Q4849072"},{"title":"Chocolate","blocks":[{"text":"Chocolate is a food made from roasted and ground cocoa beans. It can be a liquid, solid, or paste. It is eaten on its own and used to flavor other foods."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/11/Three_Bars_%281%29.jpg/330px-Three_Bars_%281%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chocolate","wikidata":"Q195"},{"title":"Baker","blocks":[{"text":"A baker is a tradesperson who bakes and sometimes sells breads and other products made of flour by using an oven or other concentrated heat source. The place where a baker works is called a bakery."}],"image":"https://t